{"id":"n84523-1-12","stage":3,"title":"할부 · 分期付款","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n84523-1-12-1","ko":"카드로 계산하시겠어요?","zh":"您要刷卡支付吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"카드로","meaning":"银行卡，储蓄卡，信用卡","explanation":"카드：银行卡，储蓄卡，信用卡；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"카드","audio":"/audio/62b41b5aaec6fef4bd83.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71472","senseId":"7","lemma":"카드","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"계산하시겠어요?","meaning":"结账，买单","explanation":"계산하다：结账，买单；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"계산하다","audio":"/audio/789e5000e94e13298d23.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62498","senseId":"2","lemma":"계산하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"62b41b5aaec6fef4","term":"카드","zh":"银行卡，储蓄卡，信用卡","audio":"/audio/62b41b5aaec6fef4bd83.mp3","entryId":"71472","definition":"在购物或接受服务后，可当场或过一段时间后付款的支付工具，是个呈方型的塑料片。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"789e5000e94e1329","term":"계산하다","zh":"结账，买单","audio":"/audio/789e5000e94e13298d23.mp3","entryId":"62498","definition":"支付东西的价钱或费用。","pronunciation":["계ː산하다","게ː산하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ef91f7b92044c652cc5b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n84523-1-12-2","ko":"네, 이 카드는 몇 개월 무이자 할부가 되나요?","zh":"是的，这张卡可以免息分期几个月呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"카드는","meaning":"银行卡，储蓄卡，信用卡","explanation":"카드：银行卡，储蓄卡，信用卡；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"카드","audio":"/audio/62b41b5aaec6fef4bd83.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71472","senseId":"7","lemma":"카드","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"몇","meaning":"几，多少","explanation":"몇：几，多少","readings":[{"term":"몇","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66235","senseId":"2","lemma":"몇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"개월","meaning":"个月","explanation":"개월：个月","readings":[{"term":"개월","audio":"/audio/596e482d3557733c80a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17304","senseId":"1","lemma":"개월","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"무이자","meaning":"无息，没有利息","explanation":"무이자：无息，没有利息","readings":[{"term":"무이자","audio":"/audio/4726c4ab68a59ef958c2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55026","senseId":"1","lemma":"무이자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"할부가","meaning":"分期付款，分期支付","explanation":"할부：分期付款，分期支付；가：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"할부","audio":"/audio/f95cf3650960cae48d1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84523","senseId":"1","lemma":"할부","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"되나요?","meaning":"定为","explanation":"되다：定为；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"17","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"62b41b5aaec6fef4","term":"카드","zh":"银行卡，储蓄卡，信用卡","audio":"/audio/62b41b5aaec6fef4bd83.mp3","entryId":"71472","definition":"在购物或接受服务后，可当场或过一段时间后付款的支付工具，是个呈方型的塑料片。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"37ca98883f5001d4","term":"몇","zh":"几，多少","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3","entryId":"66235","definition":"用于询问不知道的数目。","pronunciation":["멷"]},{"id":"596e482d3557733c","term":"개월","zh":"个月","audio":"/audio/596e482d3557733c80a4.mp3","en